; GATE 1 v2 — complete L-shaped office greybox.
; 1 unit = 1 m. Ceilings 3.0. Player eye 1.7. Text CSG scene.
; CIRCULATION: no LOS from spawn / north hall / east hall to MoneyShotWindow.
; ReceptionCEODivider is a SOLID wall behind the desk covering window Z 8.8–14.2.
; Player enters CEO from the SIDE (south or north opening at X=26), then turns east.

